             "musicMultiRowListItemRenderer": {
              "description": {
               "runs": [
                {
                 "text": "Welcome to a delicious episode of \"Like \u0026 Describe\" LIVE from VidCon 2024! Join MatPat with food legends @EatSpicywithTee , @hyuneeEats , and Chef Josh of @mythicalkitchen as they dive into the fascinating world of mukbangs. From their origins in South Korea to their global phenomenon status, we explore the evolution of this sensory delight and its impact on YouTube and beyond. Discover the unique journey of mukbang creators, the role of ASMR, and the creative ways food and entertainment merge through the lens of our panel of esteemed eaters. \n\nLet us know your favorite mukbang moments in the comments and check out the incredible creators featured in this video! \n\nHost Creators: \nMatPat\n@hyuneeEats \n@EatSpicywithTee \n@mythicalkitchen \n\nFeatured Creators:\n@FirstWeFeast \n@LINHASMR \n@AliIceberg \n@Bloveslife \n@dona_mukbang \n@HunniBeeASMR \n@Jane_asmr \n@atjulie \n@TheOfficialPrinceFamily \n@VikkyASMR \n@ZachChoi \n@foomuk \n\n#Mukbang\n#MatPat\n#likeanddescribe \n\n00:00 Intro\n3:40 Era 1: The Origins of Mukbang\n8:37 Era 2: YouTube South Korean Origins \n16:30 Era 3: Global Expansion and the Rise of ASMR\n28:49 Era 4: Evolution of Mukbang Crossovers"
                }
               ]
