             "musicMultiRowListItemRenderer": {
              "description": {
               "runs": [
                {
                 "text": "Join gymnastics insider @pengpengclee, golf extraordinaire @GrantHorvatGolfs, wrestling champion @CaydenHenschel, running guru @AlexisBlack, and table tennis master Emil of @Pongfinity, together with host MatPat as they dive into the fascinating world of non-team sports on YouTube in episode 7 of Like \u0026 Describe. This all-star lineup of creators are not only revolutionizing how we experience athletics online, they’re also pioneering a whole new form of sports entertainment.\n\nDiscover the secrets behind sports content creation, the most viral trick shots, hilarious challenges, and unexpected crossovers that are bringing year-round attention to these individual sports. 🏅🎥\n\nGuest Creators: \n@pengpengclee \n@GrantHorvatGolfs \n@CaydenHenschel \n@AlexisBlack \n@Pongfinity \n\n#YouTube #LikeAndDescribe #Olympics"
